理取消“允许计算机关闭此设备以节约电源”\n- OpenClaw 网关进程用守护方式运行（崩了自动拉起）\n\n这不是 7x24 最优，但比现在稳定很多。\n\n---\n\n你要的话我可以直接按“新手零基础”带你选一个 VPS 平台并告诉你每一步点哪里。你只要回复一句：  \n**“从买 VPS 开始带我”**。","textSignature":"msg_00388082f972de190169a43e5678dc8191a0a3fe0ba0a8faf1"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":402,"output":390,"cacheRead":10880,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11672,"cost":{"input":0.0007035,"output":0.00546,"cacheRead":0.0019039999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0080675}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772371540184}}
{"type":"message","id":"c5e8e49d","parentId":"d3e821f9","timestamp":"2026-03-01T13:27:55.994Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sun 2026-03-01 22:27 GMT+9] 屏幕可以熄灭 电源从不对吧"}],"timestamp":1772371675991}}
{"type":"message","id":"4c3deeed","parentId":"c5e8e49d","timestamp":"2026-03-01T13:27:59.699Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]对，**就是这个思路**：\n\n- ✅ **屏幕可以熄灭**\n- ✅ **睡眠要设为“从不”**\n- ✅ **休眠也建议关掉**\n\n这样电脑“看起来黑屏”，但系统和网关进程还在跑。\n\n再补两项更稳：\n\n1. 网卡别省电（设备管理器里关掉“允许计算机关闭此设备”）  \n2. 合上笔记本盖子时设置为“**不采取任何操作**”（如果是笔记本）\n\n要不要我给你一份 Windows 里逐项点击路径（控制面板/设置里具体在哪）？","textSignature":"msg_00388082f972de190169a43edc047c81919cff76b242c9f161"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":518,"output":152,"cacheRead":11136,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11806,"cost":{"input":0.0009065,"output":0.002128,"cacheRead":0.0019487999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0049832999999999995}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772371675993}}
{"type":"message","id":"2dde7797","parentId":"4c3deeed","timestamp":"2026-03-01T13:28:10.518Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sun 2026-03-01 22:28 GMT+9] 我是台式机"}],"timestamp":1772371690514}}
{"type":"message","id":"9dcbfa74","parentId":"2dde7797","timestamp":"2026-03-01T13:28:16.582Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]那更简单了，台式机只要这几项：\n\n1. **睡眠：从不**  \n2. **休眠：关闭**（可选但推荐）  \n3. **网卡省电：关闭**（很关键）  \n4. **Windows 更新“活动时间”设置好**，避免半夜自动重启\n\n你现在这样配就行：  \n- 屏幕熄灭没问题  \n- 主机不断电、不睡眠就能持续在线\n\n如果你愿意，我下一条直接给你**台式机一键 PowerShell 命令**，一口气把这些全设好。","textSignature":"msg_00388082f972de190169a43eec5c988191bc34de913588d135"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":186,"output":146,"cacheRead":11648,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11980,"cost":{"input":0.0003255,"output":0.002044,"cacheRead":0.0020384,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.004407899999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772371690516}}
